    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "McGovern Estates is delighted to present No. 149 Beachdale, ideally located just off Sea Road and close to the village of Kilcoole. Set within a peaceful private cul-de-sac in this highly sought-after development, this extended detached bungalow offers an exciting opportunity to create a home to suit your own taste and requirements.\r\n\r\nFilled with natural light, the open-plan extension creates a spacious living and dining area with a dual aspect and direct outlook onto the private south-facing rear garden. The garden features a beautiful patio area and substantial block-built shed, offering excellent additional storage and potential for further use, subject to the necessary permissions.\r\n\r\nWhile the property would benefit from some modernisation, it offers excellent potential in a desirable residential setting. With generous accommodation, a private south facing garden and convenient location, No. 149 Beachdale is an opportunity not to be missed.\r\n\r\nMcGovern Estates highly recommends an internal viewing to fully appreciate the space and potential this property has to offer.\r\n\r\nThis 3 bedroom family home extends to 94.6c.m2 (1,018.27sq.ft) and comprises of an entrance hallway, kitchen/dining room, Dining/ Living room, sunroom, three bedrooms and a family bathroom.\r\n\r\nKilcoole, once a sleepy coastal village, is now a thriving up and coming community with many facilities including a secondary school, two primary schools, local shopping centre, pubs, church and the world- class Druids Glen Hotel & Golf Club.\r\n\r\nKilcoole is situated near the stunning Wicklow mountains, giving easy access to the local beaches, beautiful countryside, and nearby villages of Greystones, Delgany and Enniskerry.\r\n\r\nGreystones is located just 2.5km away and a host of sports and leisure clubs around in the area including sailing, rowing, football, rugby, tennis and GAA and the Shoreline Leisure Centre and swimming pool as are renowned golf clubs, including Greystones, Powerscourt and Druids Glen.\r\n\r\nLocated just 2.5km from the N11/M50 road network, 35km from Dublin city, Kilcoole is also served by bus and mainline train routes to the city Centre and is soon to have an extension to Greystones for the DART.\r\n\r\nACCOMMODATION\r\nEntrance Hallway\r\nCarpeted flooring, decorative coving, alarm panel, smoke alarm, hot press off hallway.\r\n\r\nKitchen/ Dining Room\r\nTiled flooring, decorative coving, fully fitted kitchen, floor and wall based storage cupboards, stainless steel sink unit, ample countertop space, dual aspect, three large windows, oil boiler unit.\r\n\r\nDining/ Living Room\r\nCarpeted flooring, decorative coving, feature open fire with solid wood mantle, red brick and slate hearth, dual aspect, door to the sunroom. \r\n\r\nSunroom\r\nSolid wood flooring, sliding door to private south facing rear garden.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\nCarpeted flooring, decorative coving, feature raised fireplace, bay window overlooking front lawn.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\nCarpeted flooring, decorative coving, floor to ceiling built-in wardrobe, overlooking rear patio.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\nCarpeted flooring, overlooking side of the property.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom\r\nFully tiled bathroom, decorative coving, WC, pedestal wash-hand basin, wall mirror, shaving light, fully tiled shower unit with Triton T80 power shower, Dimplex wall heater, exterior window, attic access.\r\n\r\nFront Gardens\r\nCobblelock driveway and paving, ample off street parking, grass lawn.\r\n\r\nRear Gardens\r\nPrivate south facing rear garden with raised patio, concrete block built shed with pitched roof, large side access. \r\n\r\nSPECIAL FEATURES\r\n•Enviable detached bungalow\r\n•Private cul de sac setting\r\n•Private south facing rear garden\r\n•Solid concrete block built shed\r\n•Spacious living room extension \r\n•Further scope to extend \r\n•Spacious front & rear gardens\r\n•Double glazed throughout\r\n•Composite front door\r\n•Off street parking for multiple cars\r\n•Fully alarmed\r\n•Broadband available\r\n•All mains services\r\n•Vacant posession\r\n•No management fees\r\n•Wonderful location off Sea Road\r\n•Short walk to Kilcoole main street\r\n•Short distance to Kilcoole beach"
      },
